{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "beb56b20934eaa06fe001d747c81a238ae01a0017a85469755013b305bb297f3", "ja": "ドジっ子と天然ボケ", "zh": "冒失娘与天然呆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "55483a6114867267aa1008e48ee6a5b1dccf570812b81caff9ab88e171c0c564", "ja": "配信番組収録当日。他のゲストに『仲良し\n姉妹』や『仲間でライバル』などの関係性を\n先に使われてしまい、焦る春香と未来。その\n結果、ふたりはドジっ子と天然ボケのコンビ\n『はるみら』と命名される。", "zh": "直播节目录制当天。『要好姐妹』、『伙伴兼对手』之类的关系都被其他嘉宾先用掉了，春香和未来焦急不已。结果，两人被命名为由冒失鬼和天然呆组成的组合『春未来』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9ff63f495b86170e9e645880b0ba548e11c6721c0e6cc868d672099c0cb5384f", "ja": "（いよいよ配信番組の収録日。春香と未来は\n『仲良し姉妹』で押していくと言っていたが……）", "zh": "（终于到了录制直播节目的日子。春香和未来说过要以“关系要好的姐妹”为卖点，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "fbd656aec40eaa99b7b46903db69b4a7b6f391be27b1aaf6c53cde38e5f2b9b8", "ja": "みなさん、はじめまして！\n765プロの天海春香です！", "zh": "大家初次见面，你们好！\n我是765事务所的天海春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "e752fc29d24b7eac341af86faa513870be5858258009829c474b2e0aa688d590", "ja": "同じく、765プロの春日未来です！\nよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "同样来自765事务所的春日未来！\n请大家多多指教～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f799011631bf0eaa47d23e1b8dd78a443523a3a3c9629b480e82d636c67171c9", "ja": "（うん、緊張はしてないみたいだ。\nふたりとも今日は存分に目立ってくれよ！）", "zh": "（嗯，她们好像没紧张。今天就尽情大放异彩吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1004_mc", "source_sha256": "fa02cc02e94478ff0e18643817fdd05e64b71c9bb1633183bd46c49d8c2335b7", "ja": "それでは最後の自己紹介、\nお笑い芸人の『保土ヶ谷姉妹』のおふたりです。", "zh": "接下来是最后的自我介绍，\n有请搞笑艺人“保土谷姐妹”两位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1005_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "d204b994ceebe89df8fb02a1300de28c342ddab6c2418d306c6f754af672c33b", "ja": "保土ヶ谷姉妹です。私が姉で、隣にいるのが……\nええと、どなたでしたっけ？", "zh": "是保土谷姐妹。我是姐姐，旁边这位是……\n呃，她叫什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1006_hodogayaimoto", "source_sha256": "b7c0e2e28ea5056d0c178edf07d2d8b78559dea8ae40232a595b617c52045771", "ja": "コンビ名が姉妹なんだから妹でしょ！　……と、\nこんな感じの仲良し姉妹でやらせてもらってますぅ。", "zh": "组合名都叫姐妹了，当然是妹妹吧！……总之，我们就是以这种关系要好的姐妹组合身份活动着～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "152c786fe9479ac3ba63ee222d2f206e26a2c055d7884427b18354386c312cc3", "ja": "あっ！？　『仲良し姉妹』がとられた！？", "zh": "啊！？“要好的姐妹”被抢先用掉了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1008_mc", "source_sha256": "053ae917d74137d85cafb57b43538c038903213c9d82ce789e40cda6cd61cbc8", "ja": "はい？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "ad0c8807275d45e355de1d9d6a8c6dcbff896fe23fead208a614f44c361576d1", "ja": "あっ！　いえいえ、\nなんでもないです。えへへ……。", "zh": "啊！没、没什么，\n什么都没有。嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1010_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "b3df115acfe2d340af05fd1df57f051eb7f0a797e52db44cdea9f99598524b0c", "ja": "もしかして姉妹ってところが気になったの？\nでも私たちは本当の姉妹じゃないの。", "zh": "难道是对“姐妹”这点感到在意吗？\n不过，我们并不是真正的姐妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "b5c90ff8d5dfa2f15bb72306a8744467a7d64ea2195d25449b4eea53e650dbf1", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？\nお顔がよく似てるので、てっきり……。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？\n因为你们的长相很像，我还以为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1012_hodogayaimoto", "source_sha256": "f7d30c1446667ca68677683145bdf019a6ab515719bfc22555c12fb8ad2138eb", "ja": "それは本当にたまたまなの。最初は職場の先輩後輩で、\n面白そうだからってコンビ組んだだけで。", "zh": "那真的只是碰巧而已。最开始我们只是工作上的前后辈，因为觉得好像很有意思，才组了搭档。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1013_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "5dc4eaa636abf8e8c9c58fa31be8ae6299a5c2358eae293c70e64a2506a9d531", "ja": "顔もそっくりなら性格も、食べ物の好みまで\n似ていてね。今も一緒に暮らしてるのよ。", "zh": "不仅长得很像，性格也很像，连喜欢吃的东西都一样呢。现在也还住在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "d2c598552ad185676ec81b097e514dd26df2a8fe58eb019ed2bb7537cf0fa910", "ja": "一緒に暮らしている……。\nすっごく、仲良しなんですね……！", "zh": "一起生活……  \n关系一定特别好吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1015_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "031fce0d5f94af416e50ee328c3e67046673219ca3a4de866b77ae49a5441f32", "ja": "こっそり相手の夜食を食べちゃったりしても\n平気なの。同じもの補充しておけばいいんだから。", "zh": "就算偷偷把对方的夜宵吃掉也没关系。只要补上同样的东西就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1016_hodogayaimoto", "source_sha256": "fed15245a78124836e084479ff0f627ec3136accd2445d261626ea7fc0836015", "ja": "それなら最初から自分の夜食を食べなって！\nなんの意味もない行為だよ！", "zh": "既然这样，一开始就吃自己的夜宵啊！这根本是毫无意义的行为！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "d464a3ea70b70e899384084afdbff99da1e74d24047ad6f0598848c94e045e96", "ja": "あははっ！　やっぱり芸人さんは面白いなぁ。", "zh": "啊哈哈！果然搞笑艺人就是有意思啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "d734994783acf788f2a75bb73eb533b7d1c25b85fae29632f5e4f3c5222115e1", "ja": "ふふ、ほんと……って笑ってる場合じゃなかった。\nあとで、作戦会議をやり直さないと……！", "zh": "呵呵，真的……不过现在可不是笑的时候。之后得重新开作战会议才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1019_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2a60f24ba2c382306b26b35ac69719655130a81e3ec8bc8f3930565eff34456a", "ja": "前半は完全に芸人さん達のペースだったな……。\nずっと聞き手に回っていたけど、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "前半完全是那帮艺人掌握着节奏啊……  \n你一直都在当听众，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "e01e2c232446c20bbdf5caa77a076cfc0a3087b7d2b139102ff59dfbc83a534e", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です！　えっとえっと、\n私と春香さんの関係は……仲間でライバルですから！", "zh": "没、没问题！那个那个，我和春香的关系……是伙伴，也是竞争对手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "11251c5e80b6ccda3fe229e3a390147c798512658fa2efd2621b791f1208ed4d", "ja": "うん、すごくアイドルらしい関係だと思うしね！\nエピソードとか、思い出しておくといいのかも。", "zh": "嗯，而且我觉得这是很有偶像风范的关系呢！\n回忆一下相关的经历之类，说不定会比较好哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "6850b7df6ccb0e9bcfce06f906a46d04a9fd60ab8f686f60137f919759a1aa03", "ja": "あっ、確かに！\nうーんと、この間の公演の時に……。", "zh": "啊，确实！\n唔——前阵子公演的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "0501490dabc084da457591aa74c70cc6f35d7fa68b8c363ba347df1d10faa574", "ja": "その路線で決め打ちするのも危険な気がするけど……\nとにかく、頑張っていこう！", "zh": "但在那条路线上一意孤行，感觉也有些危险……\n总之，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1025_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1026_mc", "source_sha256": "bd8ebc97c9a4bb66d866de78883e029e0160738a796c24fc32522c2d0ef65be9", "ja": "女子テニスで活躍されてるおふたりは……確か\nプロデビューの前から先輩後輩だったんですよね？", "zh": "活跃于女子网坛的两位……我记得\n在转为职业选手之前就是学姐学妹了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1027_kohaitenisen", "source_sha256": "f28cdc88c95f9241562031a4c70214a11597d40fc0c57c5df80b40cc36524980", "ja": "はい。中学校の時から、プロになった今でも\nずっとその関係で……厳しい先輩ですね。", "zh": "是的。从初中时起直到现在成为职业偶像，我们一直保持着那种关系……真是位严格的前辈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1028_senpaitenisen", "source_sha256": "8b56f72d8c20c55abb563ce690cd6735e71c63ac0549acc46cea4cf934f05bf9", "ja": "ふふっ。あまりベタベタしないせいかな？\nでも、少し緊張感があるのが私達かなって。", "zh": "呵呵。可能是因为我们不太会黏在一起吧？\n不过，我觉得，稍微有点紧张感才是我们的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1029_senpaitenisen", "source_sha256": "c43961e0bc6d717a3f723b43c91a10f4319b68c79986ebc4a85aad3026c06254", "ja": "ダブルスでは仲間、個人では競い合う……。\n仲間でありライバルでもあるので。", "zh": "双人赛时是伙伴，个人赛时则互相竞争……\n因为既是伙伴，也是对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "e7a32bd853792037d03fda40d7602588f22af1059d8f5512caca9a1420f1d849", "ja": "ああっ！？\n『仲間でライバル』もとられちゃった……！？", "zh": "啊啊！？\n“既是伙伴又是对手”也被抢先说了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1031_mc", "source_sha256": "9ea82c5fa8d2b5dd24bb89d85c9047f22c059bc64fe6f077dcf60b9fbd7f7d60", "ja": "おや、アイドル代表の未来ちゃん。\n主張したいことがあるようですね、どうぞ！", "zh": "哎呀，是偶像代表未来呀。看来你有想说的事情，那就说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "5f4e9dbe166b94d0bf34e2bb6bbcbb5091536d1b4c18ff8ac5d66cba9637e03b", "ja": "えっ！？　あの、そういうわけじゃなくって……！", "zh": "诶！？那个，不是这样的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "97cb0cd7ea8c14f0720bedba6325f075b0c30c1d903987ab4be0eeacee82a3a2", "ja": "お、落ち着いて未来ちゃん。\nここは、チャンスだと思うから、しっかり……！", "zh": "冷、冷静点，未来。\n我觉得现在正是机会，所以一定要好好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1034_kohaitenisen", "source_sha256": "4a8bf0d9a4e84235a03a88b2220fdc8d2f534d21791b265152be9084e003000d", "ja": "あの……ピンマイクを抑えないと、いくら声を\n小さくしても拾っちゃうんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "那个……要是不把领夹麦捂住的话，\n声音压得再低也是会被收进去的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1035_001har", "source_sha256": "f537bb6f2cf30cee945728ab39f986b23c562d99addd16102a656ef984a90f9f", "ja": "はっ！？　そ、そうですよね……っ！？\nあはは、私ってホントにドジで……。", "zh": "啊！？对、对哦……！？\n啊哈哈，我真是太冒失了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "af42266d53d4f34c3287d1975f2c8389079ff2377033b3cc9f2dafda8fee71e6", "ja": "えーと、春香さんと私は『仲良し姉妹』で、\n『仲間でライバル』で……あとあと……！", "zh": "呃——春香前辈和我是“关系要好的姐妹”，\n是“伙伴兼对手”，还有还有……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "b6098db908415d549414f8216ad135cc1cbc420b14df69bf6e1552ab3ea46af4", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！\n私と春香さんは、先輩と後輩です！", "zh": "啊，对了！\n我和春香前辈是前辈和后辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1038_hodogayaimoto", "source_sha256": "9d8d325813fa0ae138f4e8e2545167ab88d9d8b58574d64992d7a323711ea185", "ja": "それはみーんなそうでしょ！！　先輩と後輩だよ！！\nここで迷いなくボケるなんて、もしかして天然……？", "zh": "那肯定是大家都这样吧！！是前辈和后辈呀！！\n居然能在这里毫不犹豫地犯傻，难道是天然呆……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "8d1ada3c50440539a4a0e1a39e474c3fa77140fc35bc900f5846e0bc0e5babd3", "ja": "そ、そっか！\n思いついちゃったから、つい……。", "zh": "这、这样啊！\n因为突然想到了，就不由得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1040_senpaitenisen", "source_sha256": "ac01cb1f047166d6f5d1c6342ec141663158de0aa7b80d3eb5c54c8c23e8b31c", "ja": "ふふっ、基本から考えるのは大事ですからね。\n不思議な雰囲気のコンビかも。", "zh": "呵呵，从基础开始考虑是很重要的呢。\n也许是个氛围很奇妙的组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1041_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "96d3f8132ae20757c3701e47d72a19f947f4f98b924f314b550fc5f453135ffe", "ja": "ドジっ子と天然ボケ……素質を感じるわ。\nそう思わない？", "zh": "冒失女孩和天然呆……我感觉很有潜力呢。  \n你不这么认为吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1042_hodogayaimoto", "source_sha256": "84abed976cb930787f4736dcd6deed46eae710d47556da4a3c44e564342316f6", "ja": "周りが突っ込まずにはいられなかったものねぇ。\n『はるみら』って感じかしら？", "zh": "周围的人都忍不住要吐槽了呢。\n有种“春未来”的感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1043_001har", "source_sha256": "1b4d8274c729b385d9edc7bb547b1da4afdf0ecc02da69dff2838324a53e35e7", "ja": "えっ！？　『はるみら』っていうのは、\nまさか……。", "zh": "诶！？你说的『春未来』，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1044_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "52a6124b6df1627f07b0d67bac06cc8dbfa1fb68d0b5f713511dc7600de6c5fe", "ja": "あなたたちのコンビ名。どう？", "zh": "你们的组合名。觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "98fa67a92a1adb68b0bb3f2a5900a1222e98ef56fe95a3fffabe3891ce12b5f2", "ja": "い、いや！　私たちは芸人さんじゃなくて、\nアイドルなんですけど……うう～……。", "zh": "不、不是啦！我们不是喜剧演员，是偶像才对……呜呜～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "9cef30a0db3d463b2d36004288ee02f49c7c25fba3e1856b38bdcdfa303b2fc6", "ja": "（イジられる方向に転がるとは……でも、スタジオ\n受けもいいし、これはこれでアリなのでは……？）", "zh": "（居然朝着被调侃的方向发展了……不过，摄影棚里的反响也不错，这样也未尝不可吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
